usage: janus validate [-h] [--environment ENVIRONMENT]
                      [--project-root PROJECT_ROOT] [--source-id SOURCE_ID]
                      [--format {text,json}]

Load the source registry, resolve its graph, and plan every source, without
running any.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --environment ENVIRONMENT
                        Environment profile name under conf/environments
                        without the .yaml suffix.
  --project-root PROJECT_ROOT
                        Project root used to resolve conf/ and data/ paths.
  --source-id SOURCE_ID
                        Plan only this source; the semantic pass still covers
                        the whole registry.
  --format {text,json}  Report format. Defaults to text.
